              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-branes"} M2-branes
              is indeed an
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integer"} integer
              on the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/product+space"} product space
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
